      "side": 1,
      "message": "One meta-comment about this change: the API change to `SkShaderBase` makes color filters and shaders subtly different. For shaders, we now override `appendStages` (or `appendRootStages`) but for color filters, we still override `onAppendStages`.\n\nThis is easily fixable--`SkColorFilterBase::appendStages` is a total no-op that just thunks into `onAppendStages`. I think we can just rename all the `onAppendStages` methods to `appendStages` and call it fixed. We don\u0027t need to do that in this CL, but it seems like something we ought to change for consistency.",
      "revId": "613ccf394055fa7a6e6e6d61921a51e145fd0bc9",
